{"type": "excalidraw", "version": 2, "source": "Horizon", "elements": [{"id": "e0", "type": "text", "x": 25, "y": 20, "width": 503.68, "height": 41.6, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e40af", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1.5, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "seed": 100, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "WAL：让提交不用一直等到脏页写回", "originalText": "WAL：让提交不用一直等到脏页写回", "fontSize": 32, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.3}, {"id": "e1", "type": "text", "x": 25, "y": 73, "width": 867.72, "height": 27.3, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#374151", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1.5, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "seed": 101, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "缓冲池先积累修改，再按策略批量刷脏；同一页的多次修改可以合并写回，减少数据页 I/O。", "originalText": "缓冲池先积累修改，再按策略批量刷脏；同一页的多次修改可以合并写回，减少数据页 I/O。", "fontSize": 21, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.3}, {"id": "e2", "type": "text", "x": 25, "y": 116, "width": 546, "height": 27.3, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#64748b", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1.5, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "seed": 102, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "代价：从修改内存到数据页落盘，中间可能隔着较长时间。", "originalText": "代价：从修改内存到数据页落盘，中间可能隔着较长时间。", "fontSize": 21, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.3}, {"id": "e3", "type": "text", "x": 155, "y": 185, "width": 202.44, "height": 54.6, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e40af", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1.5, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "seed": 103, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "修改缓冲池\n页变脏：100 → 120", "originalText": "修改缓冲池\n页变脏：100 → 120", "fontSize": 21, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.3}, {"id": "e4", "type": "line", "x": 240, "y": 250, "width": 0, "height": 255, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#cbd5e1", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1.5, "strokeStyle": "dashed", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "seed": 104, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "points": [[0, 0], [0, 255]]}, {"id": "e5", "type": "text", "x": 465, "y": 185, "width": 250, "height": 54.6, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#047857", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1.5, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "seed": 105, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "有 WAL：必要日志落盘\n可确认同步提交", "originalText": "有 WAL：必要日志落盘\n可确认同步提交", "fontSize": 21, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.3}, {"id": "e6", "type": "line", "x": 570, "y": 250, "width": 0, "height": 255, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#cbd5e1", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1.5, "strokeStyle": "dashed", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "seed": 106, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "points": [[0, 0], [0, 255]]}, {"id": "e7", "type": "text", "x": 1165, "y": 185, "width": 153.72, "height": 54.6, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e40af", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1.5, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "seed": 107, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "按策略刷脏\n数据页写成 120", "originalText": "按策略刷脏\n数据页写成 120", "fontSize": 21, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.3}, {"id": "e8", "type": "line", "x": 1250, "y": 250, "width": 0, "height": 255, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#cbd5e1", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1.5, "strokeStyle": "dashed", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "seed": 108, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "points": [[0, 0], [0, 255]]}, {"id": "e9", "type": "text", "x": 25, "y": 286, "width": 103.68, "height": 31.200000000000003, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#374151", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1.5, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "seed": 109, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "没有 WAL", "originalText": "没有 WAL", "fontSize": 24, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.3}, {"id": "e10", "type": "rectangle", "x": 240, "y": 275, "width": 1010, "height": 72, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#dc2626", "backgroundColor": "#fee2e2", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1.5, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "seed": 110, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "roundness": {"type": 3}}, {"id": "e11", "type": "text", "x": 355, "y": 